  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Rehabilitacin de la Red de Distribucin de Electricidad de Puerto Prncipe</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rehabilitation of the Electricity Distribution System in Port-au-Prince</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Contribuir a sostener la continuidad y calidad de los servicios de electricidad a la poblacin de la zona metropolitana de Puerto Prncipe, y a mejorar la situacin financiera y de gestin de la Electricidad de Hait (EDH). Realizar obras en baja, media y alta tensin contempladas en la operacin original (HA-L1014), as como otras en el marco de los componentes del proyecto que den respuesta a los efectos del terremoto sobre el sistema de distribucin de electricidad.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contribute to the uninterrupted and quality power supply to the Port au Prince population, as well as to the improvement of the financial and management situation of Electricit de Haiti. Support the development of high, medium and low voltage works initially included in the original operation (HA-L1014), as well as other works within the project&apos;s components that may help respond to the effects of the earthquake on the power distribution system.</narrative>
  </description>
